add('lem-it-finite-gentle-measurement','lemma',pg,['thm-qc-purification-existence-and-unitary-equivalence','thm-qc-trace-distance-channel-contractivity'],'If 0<=Lambda<=I and Tr Lambda rho>=1-u, then ||rho-sqrt(Lambda)rho sqrt(Lambda)||_1<=2sqrt(u). For PSD X of trace<=1 the bound is 2sqrt(Tr X * Tr[(I-Lambda)X]).','Purify X, compute the exact rank-one trace norm difference sqrt((a+q)^2-4|overlap|²), use sqrt(Lambda)>=Lambda and partial-trace contraction. This is raw trace norm, not halved distance.')
